## PCB sample: simple rectangular conductor
## Required labels: (none)
## Optional labels: (none)
## Note: PCB analysis uses FastHenry .inp, not .vol mesh.
##       This .jou creates a minimal geometry for field evaluation.
##
## Usage: Solve -> Radia-NGSolve -> PCB

reset

# Simple rectangular conductor (10mm x 1mm x 0.035mm copper trace)
brick x 0.010 y 0.001 z 0.000035
move volume 1 x 0.005 y 0.0005 z 0.0000175

# Air domain for field evaluation
brick x 0.020 y 0.010 z 0.005
move volume 2 x 0.010 y 0.005 z 0.0025

subtract volume 1 from volume 2

imprint volume all
merge volume all

block 1 add volume 1
block 1 name "conductor"
block 2 add volume 2
block 2 name "air"

volume all scheme tetmesh
volume all size auto factor 7
mesh volume all
